"OneLogin. Identity providers are integrated on a per-Tenant basis in "
"|morpheus|. From the selected Tenant, click :guilabel:`IDENTITY SOURCES`."
" The list of currently-integrated identity providers is here. Click "
":guilabel:`+ ADD IDENTITY SOURCE` to start a new integration for "
"OneLogin. Fill in the fields below:"
